blurry-a 2026-11-26: gem.png, nugget.png, gold_bag.png: taken from the game's own art: Pawnbarian (j4nw) official press-kit desktop screenshot 20210917164948_1.jpg (2560x1440; press kit https://j4nw.com/pawnbarian/presskit -> Google Drive folder 17F4lgNDt3yQltQHOIGl-okR8BvuThCPf). Gem and nugget keyed off the flat navy UI (#383961) and re-rendered at 512px; gold bag likewise with the screenshot's gold count digit painted out in the bag's own orange (bottom sits on the board frame in the game, so it is flat).
blurry-a 2026-11-26: heart.png: video sprite was clipped; best alternate: the anatomical heart icon 'heart-organ' by Lorc (game-icons.net, CC BY 3.0; Pawnbarian's original jam version credits game-icons.net) drawn in Pawnbarian's palette (#EE4266 fill, #DBE9EE outline) at 512px.
blurry-a 2026-11-26: lion.png: golden Capybear head re-rendered at 512px from the video sprite as flat palette layers in Pawnbarian's colours (#FFB53F, #383961; crisp.py crisp_layers), hard anti-aliased edges.
